constraints:
1 ≤ N ≤ 10^{5}

expected time complexity: O(Nlog(N)).
expected auxiliary space: O(N).

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def caseSort(self, s, n):
		d = ''
		(a, b) = ([], [])
		for i in range(n):
			if s[i].isupper():
				b.append(s[i])
			else:
				a.append(s[i])
		a = sorted(a)
		b = sorted(b)
		(j, k) = (0, 0)
		for i in s:
			if i.isupper():
				d += b[k]
				k += 1
			else:
				d += a[j]
				j += 1
		return d
